# Adding New Projects to your Invoice

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

* * *

(information)

## Info

To add a new project to your invoice, you should already have invoicing set up for your Twilio account(s). If you're interested in learning about setting up invoicing for your account, please [contact our Sales team(link takes you to an external page)](https://www.twilio.com/help/sales "contact our Sales team").

* * *

## The Admin Center

[the-admin-center page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/enterprise/add-projects-to-invoice#the-admin-center)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

You'll need to use the Admin Center to create a new Project and add the Project to your existing invoice. You can access the Admin Center by [signing into your Twilio account(link takes you to an external page)](https://www.twilio.com/login "signing into your Twilio account") and clicking on the dropdown in the top right corner of the Twilio Console. In order to access the Admin Center, you'll need to be an Organization admin.

![Twilio PROD Contact Center Dashboard with Admin Center highlighted.](https://www.twilio.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs-resources.prod.twilio.com%2F69038b114a4b988407a6470f87b5b088596213d9d0b8055f0f3cbc05efa71587.png&w=3840&q=75)Expand image

### What is an Organization?

[what-is-an-organization page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/enterprise/add-projects-to-invoice#what-is-an-organization)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

A Twilio Organization contains all of your company's Twilio Projects. You can use the Organization to manage separate Projects in a centralized place. You'll manage your Organization within the Admin Center.

Now that you know about the Admin Center and Organizations, you're ready to create a new project and add it to your invoicing.

**Step 1** \- Inside the Admin Center, create an additional Project in your Organization by clicking the "+" icon.

![Admin Center interface showing Projects list with a highlighted 'Create Project' button.](https://www.twilio.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs-resources.prod.twilio.com%2Ff58bfba565791c26ee27420642889c539bc91abf467b4971e5fc40a7313e0836.png&w=3840&q=75)Expand image

**Step 2** \- Set a friendly name for your Project ( [this can be changed later).(link takes you to an external page)](https://www.twilio.com/console/project/settings "this can be changed later).") Indicate if this is a Flex Project.

![Create new project form with fields for friendly name and Flex project option.](https://www.twilio.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs-resources.prod.twilio.com%2Ffa2ba67201336eaab458d45fcc8db2f066b29d20b7a6e4cdb2caac64d153631f.png&w=3840&q=75)Expand image

**Step 3** \- Your new Project is now a part of your Organization. Your Account Manager will add the new Project to your existing invoice.

