PROGRAMMABLE VOICE

WARNING

* * *

## Description

[description page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/13222#description)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

The `sendDigits` attribute may contain numbers, the `#` and `*` characters, the letters `A`, `B`, `C`, `D`, as well as lowercase `w` to "wait" for half a second or uppercase `W` to "wait" for a full second. See the [Dial Verb](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/twiml/dial "Dial Verb") API Reference for more information.

### Possible Causes

[possible-causes page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/13222#possible-causes)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

The attribute `sendDigits` includes an invalid character.

### Possible Solutions

[possible-solutions page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/13222#possible-solutions)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

Ensure the `sendDigits` attribute only contains the characters: `0123456789ABCD*#wW`.

