## Description

[description page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/18008#description)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

The individual's name on the Proof of Identity document does not match the information entered in the Bundle.

### Possible Causes

[possible-causes page anchor](https://www.twilio.com/docs/api/errors/18008#possible-causes)

Positive FeedbackNegative Feedback

